{"availability":"available","full":"GeiserX/CashPilot","name":"CashPilot","description":"Self-hosted passive income platform. Deploy once, earn everywhere. Web UI guides you through setup, deploys containers, and tracks earnings — all from your browser.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":58,"forks":17,"created":"2026-03-25T12:01:09Z","updated":"2026-10-08T22:57:14Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://geiserx.github.io/CashPilot","topics":["bandwidth-sharing","bitping","container-management","depin","docker","docker-compose","earnapp","earnings-tracker","homelab","honeygain","iproyal","mysterium","packetstream","passive-income","proxyrack","repocket","self-hosted","storj","traffmonetizer","web-ui"],"demo":"https://geiserx.github.io/CashPilot","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:56.942Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:56.942Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T08:56:56.942Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:49.555Z","stars":56,"forks":16},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:56.942Z","stars":58,"forks":17}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CashPilot is a self-hosted platform that runs passive income services on your own servers and shows what they earn in one web dashboard. Two Docker containers start the 16 services that run in Docker, keep track of the 23 that run as a browser extension, a desktop app or a GPU node, and read the balances of 15 providers into one earnings history. Without it, each provider is a container you write by hand and a dashboard you log into separately."],"features":["Starts a Docker service with one click from the catalog; no compose file to write, no YAML to edit.","Keeps every balance as history: 15 providers are read by built-in collectors every hour, so \"running but not earning\" shows as a flat line.","Treats a balance drop as a probable payout and asks you to confirm it; nothing is counted as income by guess.","Runs a fleet: one worker per server, one dashboard for all of them, every figure per server and per service.","Checks before you deploy whether the machine fits (residential IP, GPU, disk), and warns when a stored credential is about to expire."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ff6817ea55fdafa19e9acf7d6c9ebc2a6fbb3aee84eb35771e8913f60c975864","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:49.680Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:49.680Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"CashPilot is a self-hosted platform that runs passive income services on your own servers and shows what they earn in one web dashboard. Two Docker containers start the 16 services that run in Docker, keep track of the 23 that run as a browser extension, a desktop app or a GPU node, and read the balances of 15 providers into one earnings history. Without it, each provider is a container you write by hand and a dashboard you log into separately.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"CashPilot is a self-hosted platform that runs passive income services on your own servers and shows what they earn in one web dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open the welcome page asks for the token from that log line, creates the owner account and opens the setup wizard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ff6817ea55fdafa19e9acf7d6c9ebc2a6fbb3aee84eb35771e8913f60c975864","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:49.681Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T00:14:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GeiserX/CashPilot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:49.681Z","hash":"ff6817ea55fdafa19e9acf7d